00:40:11.826 --> 00:40:14.161
And then, uh, there was
blood in my face.

756
00:40:14.161 --> 00:40:15.621
-Blood everywhere.
-This...

757
00:40:16.372 --> 00:40:17.998
robbery, the-- the gunmen...

758
00:40:19.208 --> 00:40:20.668
-they do a lot of talking?
-Claro.

759
00:40:20.668 --> 00:40:23.212
They were talking so much.
Yelling, laughing.

760
00:40:23.254 --> 00:40:26.257
Uh... [speaking Spanish]

761
00:40:26.298 --> 00:40:28.426
-With the fucking guns on--
-Shut up.

762
00:40:28.467 --> 00:40:32.012
Bishop, she ID'd the driver
already, didn't she?

763
00:40:32.012 --> 00:40:34.306
On the surveillance footage.

764
00:40:34.348 --> 00:40:36.183
And that's the first time
she knew 'em?

765
00:40:36.183 --> 00:40:37.393
Yes.

766
00:40:37.435 --> 00:40:39.728
Didn't you say Rue
lived with those crackers?

767
00:40:39.770 --> 00:40:40.896
Yes.

768
00:40:46.527 --> 00:40:48.529
And she didn't recognize
their voices?

769
00:40:49.321 --> 00:40:50.531
[Bishop] No.

770
00:40:51.866 --> 00:40:52.867
Huh.

771
00:40:54.201 --> 00:40:55.494
