you guys make up,
you forgive her,

774
00:41:01.041 --> 00:41:03.878
and then she just immediately
fucks you over again.

775
00:41:04.837 --> 00:41:08.132
I've removed emotion.
It's business.

776
00:41:08.174 --> 00:41:10.301
Okay, but when you see her,
like when you look at her

777
00:41:10.342 --> 00:41:12.720
in the eye,
you don't just like...

778
00:41:12.761 --> 00:41:14.722
You know?
Like, your blood doesn't boil?

779
00:41:14.763 --> 00:41:17.391
-No.
-Not even a little bit.

780
00:41:17.391 --> 00:41:18.601
No.

781
00:41:19.310 --> 00:41:21.562
