it's all equal.

786
00:41:31.655 --> 00:41:34.074
Okay, but terrific and terrible
are not the same thing.

787
00:41:34.116 --> 00:41:35.576
Well, to me, they are.

788
00:41:35.576 --> 00:41:38.579
No, that-- what?
They're polar opposites, Maddy.

789
00:41:38.579 --> 00:41:39.955
