790
00:41:39.997 --> 00:41:42.458
It's just that difference
is of no consequence to me.

791
00:41:42.500 --> 00:41:44.418
Okay, but how is that possible?

792
00:41:44.418 --> 00:41:47.588
I've reached a state
of pure harmony.

793
00:41:47.588 --> 00:41:50.090
Okay, so what if
the busboy, you know,

794
00:41:50.132 --> 00:41:52.760
like, what if he just, like,
jerks off in your milkshake?

795
00:41:52.760 --> 00:41:53.969
Ew.

796
00:41:54.011 --> 00:41:55.846
-[chuckles]
-Why the fuck would he do that?

797
00:41:55.888 --> 00:41:59.767
Because he's not in a state
of pure harmony.

798
00:42:03.604 --> 00:42:05.856
-It all goes back to Jesus.
-Oh.

799
00:42:05.898 --> 00:42:07.816
Yeah, well, I haven't
really gotten to Jesus yet.

800
00:42:07.858 --> 00:42:09.610
You're reading the Bible,
right?

801
00:42:09.610 --> 00:42:12.571
Yeah, but it's like 900 pages
before he even shows up.

802
00:42:12.613 --> 00:42:15.866
