806
00:42:26.168 --> 00:42:27.878
That's basically
what I'm saying.

807
00:42:27.920 --> 00:42:31.131
-[♪ Western music playing]
-[spurs jingling]

808
00:42:37.012 --> 00:42:39.014
[Maddy inaudible]

809
00:42:48.357 --> 00:42:50.401
