812
00:43:02.121 --> 00:43:03.122
Hey.

813
00:43:04.290 --> 00:43:06.208
What a coincidence.

814
00:43:06.250 --> 00:43:07.835
[chuckles] Yeah.

815
00:43:08.460 --> 00:43:10.337
Pardon my manners.

816
00:43:10.379 --> 00:43:11.463
Alamo Brown.

817
00:43:11.505 --> 00:43:13.549
Maddy Perez.

818
00:43:16.010 --> 00:43:19.680
