-[clicking tongue] Let's go.

950
00:50:16.680 --> 00:50:18.598
-[knocking]
-[Cassie] Come in.

951
00:50:22.352 --> 00:50:26.106
I have worked
seven days a week,

952
00:50:26.148 --> 00:50:28.525
15 to 17 hours a day,

953
00:50:28.567 --> 00:50:30.444
and the first generous thing
I do for you,

954
00:50:30.444 --> 00:50:32.112
