959
00:50:43.874 --> 00:50:46.710
In a good way
or a bad way?

960
00:50:49.129 --> 00:50:52.507
Congratulations, job applicant.
You got the fucking part.

961
00:50:52.549 --> 00:50:55.302
[screaming excitedly]

962
00:50:55.343 --> 00:50:57.721
Oh, my God,
I'm gonna be on TV!

963
00:50:57.763 --> 00:51:00.057
-In a very small role.
