966
00:51:03.852 --> 00:51:05.812
You, me, LA Nights.

967
00:51:05.812 --> 00:51:08.273
One day we're gonna
look back at this
and we're gonna be like,

968
00:51:08.315 --> 00:51:10.525
"Pssh, you remember
when life was normal?

969
00:51:10.567 --> 00:51:13.153
"Do you remember living
in that shitty apartment

970
